{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-core/src/toolpath/mod.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:40:09.188582Z","id":"4c42016bcb7ab2c9eb42dbb5c592d57a7f8f41e10753b58c5c5ff5907c38988c","body":{"detail":"file_url returns None when not cfg(unix) (url::Url::from_file_path does not exist on wasm32-unknown-unknown), so an export rendered by a hosted build names a project path without its file:// link, where the native daemon gives one. If hosted exports are served, build the URL portably (Url::parse(\"file:///\") and path_segments_mut, matching from_file_path's encoding of SPECIAL_PATH_SEGMENT and its handling of `..`).","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":536},"end":{"line":548},"content_hash":"73804433eb012ef149abf1d37d366cf3988131fac12b6a558c31a7c7f396dfca"},"summary":"Off unix, exports render no file:// URL for an absolute path","tags":["wasm","revisit:hosted toolpath exports","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
